  "details": "I'm not sure if this is expected behavior or not.\nI set disableRichPresence to false because I don't want to expose rich presence information to Discord and Steam.\nHowever, what I did not expect was disableRichPresence also prevents from clicking Join links and Steam links that are created by other users: Clicking links will result in nothing happening in-game.\nI would have expected to be able to disable exposing information while still be able to join instances posted by event organizers.\nIs this behavior intended?",
